# Desperate Parry says "target creature", not "an opponent's creature" (CR 115.1): Bot1 casts it on its own Memnite with Mox Sapphire
# and Mox Jet, so the Memnite (1/1) gets -4/-0 and has power -3 until end of turn, the toughness is not touched, and the Adventure
# card is exiled on resolution (CR 715.4) rather than put into the graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Memnite
Obyra's Attendants
Island x3
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Obyra's Attendants.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite; Ability: Adventure)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Power = -3
Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Toughness = 1
Exile = Obyra's Attendants
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 0
